<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24937" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">irrĕmĕdĭābĭlis</span></b> 
			(<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inr-</span></b> ),
		e, adj.
		2. inremediabilis, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>incurable</i>, <i>irremediable</i>,
				<i>beyond cure</i> (post-Aug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in vino cicuta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					25, 13, 95, § 152</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b> In gen.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">scelus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					11, 53, 115, § 279</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">summa malorum, Salv. Gub. Dei, 4, p. 121:
					lacrimae,</span>”
				<i>not to be checked</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg. Job, 10, 4</span></i>
			. —</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>Implacable</i>: factio, Maecenas ap. <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep.
				114, 5</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
